    "textBodies": [
      [
        "At the opening of Waltz No. 1, the oboe is once again substituted with wooden flutes, while the harp line is rendered on a glockenspiel. These changes fundamentally alter both the instrumental texture and the overall timbral palette, replacing the warmth and subtlety of the original scoring with a brighter, more percussive sonority."
      ]
